<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose" style="max-width:76ch">
    <h2>How we handle a product enquiry</h2>
    <p>Whatever the category, the sequence is the same: you tell us the product, grade, quantity and destination; we confirm what's available at that specification and quote an FOB or CIF price; samples follow if you need them; then specification, packaging, Incoterm and payment terms go into a contract before anything is sourced or shipped. See the full <a href="/export-process/">export process</a>.</p>

    <h2>Specifications are confirmed per contract</h2>
    <p>Each product page below publishes typical specification ranges as a starting point for discussion — grade, size, moisture, admixture and so on. Those are indicative. The specification that governs your shipment is the one written into your contract, confirmed against what's actually available in that season.</p>

    <h2>Documentation</h2>
    <p>{{ site.complianceStatement }} {{ site.complianceChecklistCta }}</p>

    <h2>Don't see what you need?</h2>
    <p>We're a full-fledged export house and regularly source outside our published list. If you need an Indian-origin product that isn't shown here, <a href="/get-a-quote/">send us the requirement</a> — we'll tell you honestly whether we can supply it at the grade and volume you need.</p>
  </div>
</section>

